flowchart TD
    START([定时触发<br/>每1小时]) --> SCAN[扫描低层记忆<br/>L2/L3/L4层]
    
    SCAN --> BATCH{批量大小<br/>>100条?}
    BATCH -->|是| SPLIT[分批处理<br/>100条/批]
    BATCH -->|否| EVAL
    
    SPLIT --> EVAL[逐条评估巩固分数]
    
    EVAL --> CALC[计算多维评分]
    
    subgraph SCORING[评分计算]
        TIME[时间因子<br/>exp-hours_since_access/24]
        FREQ[频率因子<br/>1-exp-access_count/10]
        IMP[重要性因子<br/>importance×0.2]
        EMO[情感因子<br/>emotional_valence×0.15]
        REL[相关性因子<br/>relevance×0.15]
    end
    
    CALC --> TIME
    CALC --> FREQ
    CALC --> IMP
    CALC --> EMO
    CALC --> REL
    
    TIME --> MERGE[加权合并<br/>0.25+0.25+0.20+0.15+0.15]
    FREQ --> MERGE
    IMP --> MERGE
    EMO --> MERGE
    REL --> MERGE
    
    MERGE --> CHECK{分数 > 阈值?<br/>threshold=0.7-layer×0.02}
    
    CHECK -->|是| PROMOTE[提升层级<br/>Lx → Lx+1]
    CHECK -->|否| CHECK_DECAY{分数 < 0.2?}
    
    CHECK_DECAY -->|是| DECAY[标记衰减<br/>归档或删除]
    CHECK_DECAY -->|否| KEEP[保持当前层级<br/>更新访问时间]
    
    PROMOTE --> PK{是否已达<br/>L10?}
    PK -->|是| FINAL[标记为永久记忆]
    PK -->|否| INDEX[更新索引<br/>新层级+向量]
    
    INDEX --> NEXT([下一批])
    DECAY --> NEXT
    KEEP --> NEXT
    FINAL --> NEXT
    
    NEXT --> BATCH

    style START fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style PROMOTE fill:#27AE60,color:#fff
    style DECAY fill:#E74C3C,color:#fff
    style KEEP fill:#F39C12,color:#fff
    style FINAL fill:#9B59B6,color:#fff
